# Independent review receipt

Reviewer: Sagan `01a197d6-adc1-75b0-bb56-7123f75bab20`, inherited model, medium reasoning. Scope: J2 run editor model/UI/writer/project hydration and own smoke only. Read-only; no edits, no global build, no native window or physical acceptance claim.

Initial findings (all fixed):

1. P1: shared display length units were emitted into a backend comma parser that applies units per component; nonzero X/Y could be scaled incorrectly. Fixed by normalizing center/focus to base mm before emitting, with independent per-component cm/m regression and conversion-overflow rejection.
2. P2: process-case variants could collide in case-insensitive INI section names. Fixed by normalized particle/process section collision detection while preserving original process values/case for real backend matching.
3. P2: raw rotation dot-product squares could raise OverflowError on finite `1e200` vectors. Fixed by scaled stable normalization and finite unit-vector emission; parallel vectors remain rejected.

Reviewer final response:

> 当前交接版本复核通过，原三项发现均保持关闭：
> center/focus 单位转换正确，换算溢出被拒绝。
> bias process 大小写碰撞被阻断，writer 保留原始大小写。
> 1e200 向量稳定归一化，平行向量仍被拒绝。
> 已重跑 own smoke 和三个独立反例，均通过、退出码 0。未编辑文件、未扩大审查范围；不涉及阶段完成评定。

